From 355e6a6a87279f5e290cca302166b1ec6188a2c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Bloomin <452472+daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:14:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(tui): a client-less auto-continue runs as the session's
 stored source [daveey]

The startup sweep resumed paused/crashed turns via session.resume with no
source, so the record took the env fallback (tui on a backend without
HERMES_DESKTOP) and a desktop chat continued with TUI interface guidance
and without desktop-only tools. The sweep now asks for the stored source
(source_from_store), and every auto-continue kickoff adopts the stored
desktop/tui source, rebuilding an agent already built for another
platform (in-place watcher). Missing/unknown sources keep the default.

Card t_01a183149a00c941.
